OL,3,GNEWSAThird person arrested after car
OL,4,Adamaged by gunshots
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third person has been arrested after
OL,7,Farmed police responded to an incident
OL,8,Fin which a car was hit by gunshots.
OL,10,FSouth Wales Police said a vehicle on
OL,11,Fthe A48 in Morriston, Swansea,
OL,12,Fsustained damage "consistent with a
OL,13,Ffirearms discharge" on Friday and one
OL,14,Fperson was left with minor injuries.
OL,16,FA 41-year-old man, from Llansamlet, and
OL,17,Fa 16-year-old boy, also from
OL,18,FLlansamlet, were arrested in the
OL,19,Faftermath on Friday and remain in
OL,20,Fcustody.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
