OL,3,GNEWSAThird person arrested after car
OL,4,Adamaged by gunshots
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Saturday police said a 29-year-old
OL,7,Fman from Swansea had also now been
OL,8,Farrested on suspicion of affray and
OL,9,Fpossessing an offensive weapon.
